Z||000001||rodmcneill||11-09-2001||11:43 AM||||There is a good used set for sale on E-bay right now. There is also someone selling new Bendix front and rear rotors right now on E-bay. I bought the fronts 1 month ago, no one else bid $39.99+ $15.00 shipping. These were American made rotors, most other places including the Fiero Store sell Chinese made rotors.||||reg||1
Z||000002||Formula88||11-09-2001||12:06 PM||||Check your local auto parts stores, too.  I found calipers for my 88 Formula there cheaper than anywhere else.  Always check regular parts channels first.  Some stuff is still available, and it's likely cheaper there.||||reg||3
